---
import LegacyShell from '../../../components/legacy/LegacyShell.astro';
---

<LegacyShell
  lang="en"
  title="MAOMAOTOU NETWORK TECHNOLOGY · Compatibility edition"
  description="A millennium-era compatibility edition of the MAOMAOTOU site, built for old browsers."
  siteName="MAOMAOTOU NETWORK TECHNOLOGY"
  ticker="★ Welcome to the official MAOMAOTOU NETWORK TECHNOLOGY website! Established in 2026, we build satellite terminals and software. This site is best viewed at 800×600. The guestbook is open. Thanks for visiting — please add us to your bookmarks. ★"
  navTitle="SITE MENU"
  navItems={[
    { label: 'About', href: '#about' },
    { label: 'Business', href: '#business' },
    { label: 'Team', href: '#team', hot: true },
    { label: 'Contact', href: '#contact' },
    { label: 'Downloads', href: '/en/downloads/' },
    { label: 'Mascot', href: '/en/mascot/' },
    { label: 'Blog', href: '/en/blog/' },
  ]}
  updatedLabel="Last updated"
  updated="2026-11-07"
  counterLabel="You are visitor number"
  footerNote="This site uses no invented clients, cases or awards."
  backLabel="Enter the modern site »"
  backHref="/en/"
  webmasterLabel="Webmaster"
>
  <div class="panel" id="about">
    <div class="panel-title">About us</div>
    <div class="panel-body">
      <p>
        <b>MAOMAOTOU NETWORK TECHNOLOGY (GUANGDONG) CO., LTD.</b> was founded on 4 November 2026
        with a registered capital of CNY 10,000,000, registered in Wujiang District, Shaoguan, Guangdong.
      </p>
      <p>
        We build hardware, software and security together: we design and small-batch manufacture
        satellite terminals, and we write the systems that run on them. One company, one line of responsibility.
      </p>
      <p class="marquee-hint">(This compatibility page is a stylistic demonstration. For authoritative information, use the modern site.)</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="panel" id="business">
    <div class="panel-title">What we do</div>
    <div class="panel-body">
      <h2 class="section">1. Satellite terminals</h2>
      <ul class="dot">
        <li>Terminal design and small-batch manufacturing</li>
        <li>Navigation, timing and positioning module integration</li>
        <li>Remote-sensing data reception and business system integration</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="section">2. Software &amp; integration</h2>
      <ul class="dot">
        <li>Custom business systems, back office and data platforms</li>
        <li>Legacy integration, data migration and API governance</li>
        <li>Containerised deployment and observability</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="section">3. Applied AI</h2>
      <ul class="dot">
        <li>Model selection, on-premise deployment and fine-tuning</li>
        <li>Retrieval-augmented knowledge bases and internal Q&amp;A</li>
        <li>Inference cost and latency optimisation</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="section">4. Information security</h2>
      <ul class="dot">
        <li>Secure development workflow and code auditing</li>
        <li>Perimeter defence, log collection and auditing</li>
        <li>Data classification, permissions and access control</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="marquee-hint">These map to our registered business scope. No certification or permit is implied.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="panel" id="team">
    <div class="panel-title">Team</div>
    <div class="panel-body">
      <table class="data" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
        <tr>
          <th>Legal rep.</th>
          <td><a href="https://xiaoyanboke.cn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">xiaoyanboke.cn</a> — signing authority, filings, compliance</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th>Shareholder / CEO</th>
          <td><a href="https://blog.meowhead.cn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">blog.meowhead.cn</a> — operations and delivery</td>
        </tr>
